se of duty.\n\n- Adaptability: No explicit note. No direct observation. So say none.\n\n- Feedback orientation: No explicit note. No direct observation. So say none.\n\nWe must answer the specific question first, then volunteer nearby evidence. So start: I have no direct observations on decision-making quality or adaptability or feedback orientation. Then provide technical competence, attention to detail, responsibility observations.\n\nMake sure to reference that these are from notes and discussion. Provide concise answer."}
